      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Does this not mean Gerrit creates the repository before applying the supplied config?\n\nYes, correct. At creation time the important is ensuring the wanted `refStorage`.\n\n`refStorage` has its own input parameter.\nThis check ensures `args.refStorage` is consistent with the data provided by `args.gitConfig`.",
